5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to know who is actually working the late shifts. I will check the roster books for the late-turn pool.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I suspect the crowds are a myth. I will examine timed runs and crowd counts mid-city to see the truth.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I am tired of headline totals. I will look into balances in the capital ledger to see what is real.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,History repeats itself here. I will review the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme to learn from the past.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I worry about hidden delays. I will examine contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells to see what the ground hides.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, if the ledger is empty, we cannot promise new crews. I will also check crew establishment and maintenance contract.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, if the rosters are thin, the night extension is a fantasy. I will stick to my two choices.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Servas, past records are honest. I will also examine ticketing contractor fees and paving rates to understand the cost drift.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Jonathan, the ground is a liar. I will also review the two pilots from eight years ago to see what actually worked.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, your stopwatch is wise. I will also examine joint operators' committee minutes to see who must agree.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will finalize my choices. Roster books and crew establishment will show if we have the hands to run this.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I am ready. The data will show if the mid-city is truly crowded or just loud. I will stick with my two.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will stick with my two. The ledger and the fees will reveal the true financial weight of our decisions.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will stick with my two. The past is the only witness that does not flatter us. Let us see what remains.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will stick with my two. The minutes and the contingency pricing will expose the invisible bottlenecks.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Let us see if the people are there before we promise the service. I am confident in my choices.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I am excited to see the real numbers. Let us hope the crowds are not just a story.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Agreed. The data will match the reality, not the optimism. I will review my findings before we vote.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Servas,,The data will reveal the truth of our capacity. I look forward to our findings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,The past is the only honest witness. I will review my findings before we vote.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
